*** ** * ** ***

Builder class for[AudioFocusRequest](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioFocusRequest)objects.

See[AudioFocusRequest](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioFocusRequest)for an example of building an instance with this builder.  
The default values for the instance to be built are:

|------------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| focus listener and handler   | none                                                                                                                                         |
| `AudioAttributes`            | attributes with usage set to[AudioAttributes.USAGE_MEDIA](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/AudioAttributes#USAGE_MEDIA) |
| pauses on duck               | false                                                                                                                                        |
| supports delayed focus grant | false                                                                                                                                        |

<br />

